    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちぃっ！
よくこの隠れ場所を見つけたなッ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dammit! I'm impressed you were able to find my hiding place.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>待ちなさい!!
きみは、なんでスリなんて
してるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait! Tell me, why are you going around pickpocketing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふん、世の中が
ねぇちゃんみたいなマヌケな
ウスノロばかりだからさ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh, because the world is full of ditzs like you!</EnglishText>
