      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ま、注意力は足りなくても
意外に胸はあったな♪
あんた着やせするタイプなんだな？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Well, even if you are a space case you've got a surpising filled out figure, y'know? ♪ Your clothes really hide it, huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんで知ってるんだ、お前!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>H-How do you even know that?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へへへ……
ガルドをいただくついでに
ちょいと触ったのさ∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heheh... I may have felt a few things when I was grabbing that gald! ∀</EnglishText>
