      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>58692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うぅ……乙女の胸を
なんだと思ってるのよ……？
ゆるさない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Grr... Think you can just cop a feel, huh...? Don't think I'll let this slide!</EnglishText>
