    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>73336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……俺は健全な男子だぁッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...As wholesome as they come!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>73620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>実はボク……
字はヘタなんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Honestly... my handwriting is GARBAGE.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>73864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>戦闘中、&lt;Ines&gt;の顔面に
筆をベチャ〜って
やっちゃいました……わざと。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>During one battle, I hit &lt;Ines&gt; in the face with my brush... on purpose.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>74108</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>グースの温泉に
子ども料金で入ってしまいました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>At Goose's hot springs, I only paid the children's entry fee.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>74344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>特に告白する事なんてないよ。
ボク、基本的にいい子だからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't really have anything to confess. I'm a good little bean.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>50</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>74628</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私……色々サバ読んでます……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I lie about my age a lot.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>74872</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひんぱんに
呑み過ぎて記憶を失います……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have a habit of drinking too much and forgetting it all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、でも！
お酒だけはやめられませんっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I just can't stop myself from drinking!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……反省はするけど
後悔はしないから！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Even upon reflection, I regret nothing!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75588</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>自分はボケたつもりなのに
スルーされる事が多い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I attempt to make comments for comedic effect, however no one acknowledges them...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……正直、リチア様も
味覚だけは細かすぎだと感じる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Truthfully, I think that Master Lithia's palate is too limited.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76076</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>二千年……自分は戦いあきた……
……だが、これが運命であるなら
スピリアを決めて戦い続ける！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After two-thousand years, I have grown weary of combat... However, if this is what is destined for me, my Spiria shall choose to continue fighting!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>57</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76264</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>以上、告白完了</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Confessions complete.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>76964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……許しましょう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You are forgiven, child.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>59</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それにしても、あなたたち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, you all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ザンゲ多すぎだろッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Confessed WAY too much!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77388</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こらぁぁぁ〜〜〜ッッ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Unbelievable!!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>60</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83452</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ザンゲが多すぎなのを
ザンゲしなさい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You shouldn't HAVE so many sins to confess!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>61</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
