    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くぅぅ……
教会は変ってしまった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*sob* The Church has changed...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今のバレイア教会は
融和ではなく権力を
求めておる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Church of today only seeks power, not peace...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……かつてのラブラド様は
あんなお人ではなかったのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Father Labrador never used to be like this...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>教会本部が何を考えていようが
多くの信者は、バレイアの理想を
純粋に信じておるのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No matter what the head of the church thinks, many of us still genuinely believe in Velleia's ideals.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>純粋な信者のために
純粋なバレイアの教えを語る……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Spreading the true word of Velleia to honest believers...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それが、わしの役目だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That is my duty.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とうとうラブラド様は
軍とぶつかったか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Did Father Labrador finally clash with the army...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おろかな……
いや、哀れな人だな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What a fool... or rather, you have my pity...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……力を求める先には
対立しか待っていないのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When you desire power, conflict is all that awaits you...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わしは思うんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I believe that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>83504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当の勇者は、きっと
『力を求めない強さ』を
持ったお人なのだ……とな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A true hero is one who has the strength to resist the desire of power.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
